stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Designed
  Designed --> Implemented: runtime-connected + durable + policy-enforced
  Implemented --> Tested: required runs and independent review accepted
  Tested --> DeployedDark: exact release target verified / flags off
  DeployedDark --> Authorized: current scope-matched authority
  Authorized --> Enabled: named cohort activation + staffed operations
  Enabled --> Held: incident / stale evidence / withdrawn authority
  Held --> Reconciled: stop dispatch / preserve data / repair
  Reconciled --> Authorized: new acceptance required
